5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I want to ensure our new service is stable and reliable for everyone, regardless of the season.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I am curious about how our current accessibility affects who we serve and how a new expansion might shift that balance.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see what we did before! Why do we always guess? Let's look at the old stuff to see if it actually worked!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach, Rin. I suspect the devil is in the details of our funding structure, rather than the amount itself. I shall investigate the financial framework.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about the operational burden. We must ensure we have the actual skills and manpower to sustain any new commitment without burning out the staff.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that is a lovely point. I wonder if the roads or the buses might be the hidden hurdles we need to consider.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Precisely, Shizue. I think looking at the transport links and the road closures would give us a clearer picture of our physical reach.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,But what about the programs from way back? Six years ago is like a whole lifetime! I bet there are secrets in those files!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Your enthusiasm is infectious, Rin. I will also look into the equipment lines to see if our hardware is keeping pace with our ambitions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the volunteer register and the supervision training. We need to know if we have the capacity to manage more help.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into the winter road closures and the bus links. It would be a shame if our services stopped just when people needed them most.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will join you in looking at the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm picking the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops! I'm going on a treasure hunt!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall stick with the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also examine the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. We must verify if the necessary technical skills exist within our community partners.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
